    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "To Alaska R\nVANCOUVER, B.C.\nWINNI PEG\n- SEATTLE\nTACOMA\nSPOKANE\nRainier\nGlacier\nTREAS\nBANGOR\nMONTREAL\nTo The Orient\nPORTLAND\nPENDLETON\nBISMARCK\nFARGC\nBOSTON\nBILLINGS\nST.PAUL\nMINNEAPOLIS:\nYellowstone\nALBANY\n• BUFFALO\nMEDFORD\nMILWAUKEE\n20-0\nALLENTOWN\nNEWAR!\nMADISON\nHOWA MOLINE\ndude ranches\nGrand\nTeton\nduce\nCHEYENNE MATTE\nОМАНА»\nMOINES\nSAKE\nDIANAPOLIS\nDENVER\nCLEVELAND\nKRON\nTOLEDO\nPITTSBURGH\nCOLUMBUS O\nCINCINNATI\nNEW YORK TO BERMUDA\nPHILADELPHIA\nKang HANSH OAKLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO\nWASHINGTON\nOLORAD\nST.LOUIS\nYosemite\nFRESNO\nRCHMON\"\noulder\nIon 8.\nBryce\nELOUISVILLE\nO TULSA\nOKLAHOMA CITY\nNASHVILLE d\nSANTA BARBARA\nOS ANGELES\nLONG BEACH\nSAN DIEGO\nAGUA CALIENTE\nМСМИНІЯ\nALBUQUERQUE\nAMAKILLO\nPHOENIX\nBIRMINGHAM O\nHARLESTON\nFORT WORTH\nDALLAS\nEL PASO\nJACKSON MONTGOMERY\nMOBILE\nJACKSONVILLE O\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\nHOUSTON\nNEW ORLEA\nUNITED'S MAIN LINE AIRWAY\nThe Central Mid-Continent Route Linking the East\nwith All Pacific Coast Cities\nUNITED AIR LINES\n• CONNECTING AIR LINES\nSAN ANTONIO\nGALVESTON\nSTPETERSBURG\nPROWNSV\nRuth\nTayLott\nTo Mexico City V\nCentral and South Amenca\nCUBA,\nAni south America\nFLYING\nUNITED'S MAIN LINE AIRWAY\nIn amazingly swift time, your airplane carries you\ncomfortably and dependably across United's Main Line\nairway - the NEW Overland Trail.\nYour plane is the most modern. It has been minutely\ninspected and thoroughly serviced before being dispatched\non this flight to insure that it is in first class mechanical\ncondition. It is manned by a skilled and competent crew\nwhose first consideration is your security and comfort. It\nis completely equipped with plane-ground radio facilities\nand all other modern aids to precision air navigation. And\n\"behind the scenes\" are hundreds of expert technicians—\ndispatchers, mechanics, inspectors, radio operators, mete-\norologists and other air craftsmen-who contribute to the\nclock-like operation of your schedule.\nYour flight crosses some of the most interesting his-\ntorical and geographical features in the country. The\nOverland Trail-which United's Main Line airway paral-\nlels-is outstanding in romance and color. For over 100\nyears it has been the leading route of East-West travel.\nTo acquaint you with the interesting features of the\nMain Line airway, United presents you with this \"Gay\nGeography.\" The cartography is the work of Ruth Taylor.\nFor certain of the historical data included in this log;\nUnited is indebted to Frank J. Taylor.\nYOU ARE INVITED TO KEEP THIS \"GAY GEOGRAPHY\" AS A SOUVENIR OF YOUR FLIGHT.",
      "INITEI\nALIR\nES\nA Gay Grography of\nre Main Line Airway"
    ],
